150
00:10:51,484 --> 00:10:52,902
<font color="white"><i>You're not sick, are you?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

151
00:11:03,204 --> 00:11:05,873
<font color="white"><i>We will now begin the appointment ceremony</i></font><font color="white"></font>

