157
00:11:27,144 --> 00:11:28,270
<font color="white">Thank you.</font><font color="white"></font>

158
00:11:28,771 --> 00:11:30,981
<font color="white"><i>You're really something else.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

159
00:11:31,065 --> 00:11:33,025
<font color="white"><i>How did you manage to beat</i></font><font color="white">
