501
00:37:46,138 --> 00:37:48,140
<font color="white">Someone told me the suspect</font><font color="white"></font>

502
00:37:48,724 --> 00:37:50,643
<font color="white">who abducted Jeong-yo was here.</font><font color="white"></font>

503
00:37:55,982 --> 00:37:56,857
<font color="white">And?</font><font color="white"></font>

504
00:37:57,692 --> 00:37:58,693
<font color="white">He's dead.</font><font color="white"></font>

505
00:38:01,195 --> 00:38:02,029
<font color="white">What?</font><font color="white"></font>

506
00:38:02,113 --> 00:38:03,698
<font color="white">He had already died…</font><font color="white"></font>

507
00:38:06,075 --> 00:38:07,159
<font color="white">nine years ago.</font><font color="white"></font>

508
00:38:10,788 --> 00:38:12,957
<font color="white">I hoped he was still alive.</font><font color="white"></font>

509
00:38:14,166 --> 00:38:15,084
<font color="white">I prayed…</font><font color="white"></font>

510
00:38:18,170 --> 00:38:20,298
<font color="white">he wasn't dead.</font><font color="white"></font>

511
00:38:22,091 --> 00:38:24,135
<font color="white">I can't ask for his forgiveness now.</font><font color="white"></font>

512
00:38:27,805 --> 00:38:29,265
<font color="white">There's no way to set things right.</font><font color="white"></font>

513
00:38:30,516 --> 00:38:32,393
<font color="white">It's time to move on.</font><font color="white"></font>

514
00:38:33,102 --> 00:38:34,895
<font color="white">It happened so long ago, so why--</font><font color="white"></font>

515
00:38:34,979 --> 00:38:37,231
<font color="white">Because I stole Jeong-yo's place.</font><font color="white"></font>

516
00:38:38,107 --> 00:38:40,359
<font color="white">What kind of nonsense is that?</font><font color="white"></font>

517
00:38:41,986 --> 00:38:43,821
<font color="white">You performed really well back then,</font><font color="white"></font>

518
00:38:44,530 --> 00:38:47,116
<font color="white">which is why no one</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">could argue with the results.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

519
00:38:48,492 --> 00:38:50,202
<font color="white">Even if Jeong-yo had been there,</font><font color="white"></font>

520
00:38:51,162 --> 00:38:52,621
<font color="white">you would've won first place.</font><font color="white"></font>

521
00:38:53,205 --> 00:38:54,123
<font color="white">No.</font><font color="white"></font>

522
00:38:57,335 --> 00:38:58,544
<font color="white">This place was never mine.</font><font color="white"></font>

523
00:39:00,421 --> 00:39:01,505
<font color="white">But now,</font><font color="white"></font>

524
00:39:02,465 --> 00:39:04,425
<font color="white">it's too late to set things right.</font><font color="white"></font>

525
00:39:24,028 --> 00:39:25,279
<font color="white">You should've told me.</font><font color="white"></font>

526
00:39:27,531 --> 00:39:28,657
<font color="white">If you were struggling…</font><font color="white"></font>

527
00:39:30,868 --> 00:39:32,703
<font color="white">you should've told me.</font><font color="white"></font>

528
00:39:43,255 --> 00:39:45,299
<font color="white">Let's move on, Pi-o.</font><font color="white"></font>

529
00:39:46,592 --> 00:39:47,551
<font color="white">It's time…</font><font color="white"></font>

530
00:39:49,261 --> 00:39:50,554
<font color="white">to say goodbye to Jeong-yo.</font><font color="white"></font>

531
00:39:52,306 --> 00:39:53,516
<font color="white">That's what Jeong-yo</font><font color="white"></font>

532
00:39:54,642 --> 00:39:56,227
<font color="white">would want you to do.</font><font color="white"></font>

533
00:40:00,147 --> 00:40:01,399
<font color="white">He'd want you to become</font><font color="white"></font>

534
00:40:03,150 --> 00:40:05,569
<font color="white">an amazing pianist in his place.</font><font color="white"></font>

535
00:40:31,303 --> 00:40:33,347
<font color="white">I'll never leave you.</font><font color="white"></font>

536
00:40:59,248 --> 00:41:00,332
<font color="white">I'll see you there.</font><font color="white"></font>

537
00:41:02,084 --> 00:41:03,669
<font color="white">Try not to cry when you miss me.</font><font color="white"></font>

538
00:41:06,338 --> 00:41:07,214
<font color="white">Hey.</font><font color="white"></font>

539
00:41:08,215 --> 00:41:10,968
<font color="white">Are you still going to</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">make this feel like a one-sided crush?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

540
00:41:14,638 --> 00:41:15,598
<font color="white">I'll be going.</font><font color="white"></font>

541
00:41:16,515 --> 00:41:17,349
<font color="white">Okay.</font><font color="white"></font>

542
00:41:21,979 --> 00:41:22,897
<font color="white">Bye.</font><font color="white"></font>

543
00:41:57,598 --> 00:41:58,432
<font color="white">Pi-o!</font><font color="white"></font>

544
00:41:59,808 --> 00:42:01,101
<font color="white">I'll take that.</font><font color="white"></font>

545
00:42:02,561 --> 00:42:05,022
<font color="white">I told you not to come get me.</font><font color="white"></font>

546
00:42:05,105 --> 00:42:08,275
<font color="white">How could I not?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">I haven't seen you in six months.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

547
00:42:08,359 --> 00:42:10,069
<font color="white">I missed you so much that I almost cried.</font><font color="white"></font>

548
00:42:10,653 --> 00:42:13,322
<font color="white">I watched the Prague gala performance.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">You were amazing.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

549
00:42:13,405 --> 00:42:15,115
<font color="white">Did you do well at the Berlin concert too?</font><font color="white"></font>

550
00:42:16,575 --> 00:42:17,409
<font color="white">Yes.</font><font color="white"></font>

551
00:42:36,345 --> 00:42:37,638
<font color="white">Welcome back, Pi-o.</font><font color="white"></font>

552
00:42:38,222 --> 00:42:39,306
<font color="white">How have you been?</font><font color="white"></font>

553
00:42:39,974 --> 00:42:42,309
<font color="white">Can you get Pi-o's luggage from the trunk?</font><font color="white"></font>

554
00:42:42,393 --> 00:42:43,227
<font color="white">Where's Father?</font><font color="white"></font>

555
00:42:54,071 --> 00:42:54,905
<font color="white">Father.</font><font color="white"></font>

556
00:42:55,406 --> 00:42:56,740
<font color="white">Pi-o's back.</font><font color="white"></font>

557
00:43:04,248 --> 00:43:06,208
<font color="white">How have you been, Grandfather?</font><font color="white"></font>

558
00:43:13,882 --> 00:43:16,343
<font color="white">Your only grandson is back</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">after six months.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

559
00:43:16,427 --> 00:43:18,220
<font color="white">Will you at least answer him?</font><font color="white"></font>

560
00:43:18,304 --> 00:43:19,263
<font color="white">Move.</font><font color="white"></font>

561
00:43:22,641 --> 00:43:25,019
<font color="white">You're blocking the wind. Move.</font><font color="white"></font>

562
00:43:34,653 --> 00:43:35,487
<font color="white">Let's go.</font><font color="white"></font>

563
00:43:43,579 --> 00:43:45,372
<font color="white">That stubborn old man.</font><font color="white"></font>

564
00:43:45,456 --> 00:43:47,791
<font color="white">I thought he'd mellow out as he got older,</font><font color="white"></font>

565
00:43:47,875 --> 00:43:49,501
<font color="white">but he hasn't changed a bit.</font><font color="white"></font>

566
00:43:50,377 --> 00:43:51,545
<font color="white">Don't worry about it.</font><font color="white"></font>

567
00:43:52,046 --> 00:43:53,213
<font color="white">I'm fine.</font><font color="white"></font>

568
00:44:56,151 --> 00:44:58,362
<font color="white">I'VE MEMORIZED EVERYTHING.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">TAKE IT IF YOU NEED IT!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

569
00:45:23,720 --> 00:45:25,264
<font color="white">There you are, Pi-o!</font><font color="white"></font>

570
00:45:25,347 --> 00:45:26,890
<font color="white">How have you been, Ms. Han?</font><font color="white"></font>

571
00:45:27,599 --> 00:45:30,060
<font color="white">Not very well because I missed you.</font><font color="white"></font>

572
00:45:30,561 --> 00:45:33,230
<font color="white">Going to your performances</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">was my favorite thing,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

573
00:45:33,313 --> 00:45:34,898
<font color="white">but I've been too busy to go.</font><font color="white"></font>

574
00:45:36,817 --> 00:45:39,611
<font color="white">By the way, why do you look so worn out?</font><font color="white"></font>

575
00:45:39,695 --> 00:45:40,904
<font color="white">Did something happen?</font><font color="white"></font>

576
00:45:42,030 --> 00:45:43,031
<font color="white">No.</font><font color="white"></font>

577
00:45:44,491 --> 00:45:46,452
<font color="white">Well, your album is out now.</font><font color="white"></font>

578
00:45:50,205 --> 00:45:52,124
<font color="white">What do you think? It's nice, right?</font><font color="white"></font>

579
00:45:54,543 --> 00:45:58,255
<font color="white">We should probably plan a recital tour</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">around the release.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

580
00:45:58,797 --> 00:46:00,591
<font color="white">Which cities do you want to perform in?</font><font color="white"></font>

581
00:46:01,508 --> 00:46:03,760
<font color="white">The usual ones, I guess.</font><font color="white"></font>

582
00:46:05,429 --> 00:46:09,016
<font color="white">I'm thinking Seoul, Incheon,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Daejeon, Daegu, Busan,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

583
00:46:09,099 --> 00:46:12,019
<font color="white">and Tongyeong to start with.</font><font color="white"></font>

584
00:46:12,603 --> 00:46:14,396
<font color="white">What do you think? Is that too many?</font><font color="white"></font>

585
00:46:14,480 --> 00:46:15,981
<font color="white">Should we just choose four?</font><font color="white"></font>

586
00:46:18,984 --> 00:46:21,069
<font color="white">No, it's fine.</font><font color="white"></font>

587
00:47:31,348 --> 00:47:33,475
<font color="white">REDANOL</font><font color="white"></font>

588
00:48:46,590 --> 00:48:47,799
<font color="white">Pi-o?</font><font color="white"></font>

589
00:48:47,883 --> 00:48:48,967
<font color="white">KANG PI-O RECITALS</font><font color="white"></font>

590
00:48:49,051 --> 00:48:50,093
<font color="white">Kang Pi-o!</font><font color="white"></font>

591
00:48:50,177 --> 00:48:52,137
<font color="white">KANG'S "GASPARD DE LA NUIT" LAPSE</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">RAISES HEALTH CONCERNS</font><font color="white"></font></font>

592
00:48:52,220 --> 00:48:53,555
<font color="white">Open the door.</font><font color="white"></font>

593
00:48:53,639 --> 00:48:55,724
<font color="white">It's been days now, and you haven't eaten!</font><font color="white"></font>

594
00:48:58,226 --> 00:49:00,896
<font color="white">You've been so busy</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">that you haven't had time to practice.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

595
00:49:00,979 --> 00:49:02,773
<font color="white">You just feel a little worn out,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">that's all.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

596
00:49:03,482 --> 00:49:04,566
<font color="white">Once you rest up</font><font color="white"></font>

597
00:49:04,650 --> 00:49:06,276
<font color="white">and get back into a routine…</font><font color="white"></font>

598
00:49:11,448 --> 00:49:12,282
<font color="white">Pi…</font><font color="white"></font>

599
00:49:45,899 --> 00:49:46,733
<font color="white">Pi-o.</font><font color="white"></font>

600
00:49:48,610 --> 00:49:49,486
<font color="white">Mr. Do.</font><font color="white"></font>

601
00:49:52,572 --> 00:49:53,657
<font color="white">Even in this state…</font><font color="white"></font>

602
00:49:55,701 --> 00:49:56,702
<font color="white">you still can't…</font><font color="white"></font>

603
00:49:58,245 --> 00:49:59,830
<font color="white">bear to look at me?</font><font color="white"></font>

604
00:50:03,583 --> 00:50:05,627
<font color="white">I waited for so long…</font><font color="white"></font>

605
00:50:08,046 --> 00:50:09,256
<font color="white">but you still can't?</font><font color="white"></font>

606
00:50:13,218 --> 00:50:14,136
<font color="white">Why?</font><font color="white"></font>

607
00:50:16,471 --> 00:50:19,307
<font color="white">Are you uncomfortable around me</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">because of my mom?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

608
00:50:20,976 --> 00:50:23,353
<font color="white">Or is it because</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">I didn't measure up as a student?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

609
00:50:23,437 --> 00:50:25,439
<font color="white">What do you mean? That's not it at all.</font><font color="white"></font>

610
00:50:25,522 --> 00:50:26,398
<font color="white">No.</font><font color="white"></font>

611
00:50:27,899 --> 00:50:30,318
<font color="white">Just tell me the truth.</font><font color="white"></font>

612
00:50:31,236 --> 00:50:33,530
<font color="white">Did you ever think of me as your student?</font><font color="white"></font>

613
00:50:33,613 --> 00:50:35,407
<font color="white">Pi-o, what are you talking about?</font><font color="white"></font>

614
00:50:35,490 --> 00:50:36,742
<font color="white">I've really been meaning…</font><font color="white"></font>

615
00:50:38,744 --> 00:50:40,495
<font color="white">to ask you this.</font><font color="white"></font>

616
00:50:41,496 --> 00:50:44,332
<font color="white">Why did you have Jeong-yo and me</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">play the same piece?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

617
00:50:45,292 --> 00:50:46,168
<font color="white">What?</font><font color="white"></font>

618
00:50:46,251 --> 00:50:48,295
<font color="white">I told you I wanted to play</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">the third concerto,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

619
00:50:48,378 --> 00:50:50,172
<font color="white">so why did you make me play</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">the second one?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

620
00:50:50,255 --> 00:50:52,382
<font color="white">Did you do that on purpose</font><font color="white"></font>

621
00:50:52,466 --> 00:50:54,176
<font color="white">to put our differences on display?</font><font color="white"></font>

622
00:50:54,259 --> 00:50:56,928
<font color="white">Pi-o, you've got it all wrong.</font><font color="white"></font>

623
00:50:58,096 --> 00:51:00,599
<font color="white">I cared for you and Jeong-yo</font><font color="white"></font>

624
00:51:01,892 --> 00:51:03,685
<font color="white">equally as my students.</font><font color="white"></font>

625
00:51:03,769 --> 00:51:06,730
<font color="white">Then why are you being so harsh to me?</font><font color="white"></font>

626
00:51:07,314 --> 00:51:10,609
<font color="white">You knew how much I needed your help,</font><font color="white"></font>

627
00:51:10,692 --> 00:51:11,651
<font color="white">so why…</font><font color="white"></font>

628
00:51:12,861 --> 00:51:15,197
<font color="white">Why do you only feel</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">for your dead student?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

629
00:51:15,280 --> 00:51:16,531
<font color="white">That's not true.</font><font color="white"></font>

630
00:51:19,326 --> 00:51:21,203
<font color="white">I feel for you too.</font><font color="white"></font>

631
00:51:21,286 --> 00:51:22,829
<font color="white">You weigh on my mind just as much.</font><font color="white"></font>

632
00:51:24,831 --> 00:51:27,834
<font color="white">But I have nothing left to teach you…</font><font color="white"></font>

633
00:51:29,711 --> 00:51:32,923
<font color="white">because you've grown into a pianist</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">with a distinct identity.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

634
00:51:33,757 --> 00:51:35,759
<font color="white">I thought the best thing to do</font><font color="white"></font>

635
00:51:37,010 --> 00:51:38,970
<font color="white">was to stand back and quietly support you.</font><font color="white"></font>

636
00:51:39,054 --> 00:51:40,555
<font color="white">That's not true!</font><font color="white"></font>

637
00:51:41,431 --> 00:51:43,308
<font color="white">You never liked me!</font><font color="white"></font>

638
00:51:44,643 --> 00:51:47,521
<font color="white">Just say you didn't want</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">anything to do with a student like me.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

639
00:51:48,021 --> 00:51:50,774
<font color="white">Say that my skills were pathetic</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and I was all show!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

640
00:51:51,399 --> 00:51:54,194
<font color="white">Just say you didn't want a lousy student</font><font color="white"></font>

641
00:51:54,277 --> 00:51:56,530
<font color="white">who had no soul in his playing!</font><font color="white"></font>

642
00:52:23,014 --> 00:52:25,183
<font color="white">THE BREAKDOWN DID NOT START ON STAGE</font><font color="white"></font>

643
00:52:25,267 --> 00:52:27,602
<font color="white">PIANIST KANG PI-O'S DOWNFALL</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">WAS INEVITABLE</font><font color="white"></font></font>

644
00:52:36,987 --> 00:52:37,821
<font color="white">Pi-o.</font><font color="white"></font>

645
00:52:37,904 --> 00:52:39,281
<font color="white">Get up.</font><font color="white"></font>

646
00:52:39,364 --> 00:52:41,199
<font color="white">Jae-in is here, so get up.</font><font color="white"></font>

647
00:52:42,826 --> 00:52:44,244
<font color="white">You have a guest and you still…</font><font color="white"></font>

648
00:52:58,842 --> 00:52:59,759
<font color="white">Pi-o.</font><font color="white"></font>

649
00:53:01,177 --> 00:53:02,512
<font color="white">Get up and sit next to me.</font><font color="white"></font>

650
00:53:12,439 --> 00:53:16,318
<font color="white">How long are you going to keep this up?</font><font color="white"></font>

651
00:53:16,902 --> 00:53:19,029
<font color="white">Your life doesn't end</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">over one bad performance.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

652
00:53:20,071 --> 00:53:23,950
<font color="white">If you're in a slump,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">you need to find a way out of it.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

653
00:53:24,534 --> 00:53:25,535
<font color="white">I'm sorry,</font><font color="white"></font>

654
00:53:27,037 --> 00:53:28,163
<font color="white">but just leave me alone.</font><font color="white"></font>

655
00:53:29,581 --> 00:53:31,666
<font color="white">I'll take care of my own business.</font><font color="white"></font>

656
00:53:31,750 --> 00:53:35,837
<font color="white">Why don't you go on a trip</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">instead of staying in Korea?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

657
00:53:36,755 --> 00:53:39,090
<font color="white">You're struggling</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">because of all the rumors</font><font color="white"></font></font>

658
00:53:39,174 --> 00:53:40,967
<font color="white">and people judging you.</font><font color="white"></font>

659
00:53:41,885 --> 00:53:44,638
<font color="white">If you go on that trip to Europe</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">you've been talking about</font><font color="white"></font></font>

660
00:53:44,721 --> 00:53:46,222
<font color="white">and get some rest…</font><font color="white"></font>

661
00:53:48,308 --> 00:53:49,893
<font color="white">Where can I hide?</font><font color="white"></font>

662
00:53:51,436 --> 00:53:53,855
<font color="white">It won't change the fact</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">that I can't play the piano,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

663
00:53:54,439 --> 00:53:56,149
<font color="white">so where am I supposed to hide?</font><font color="white"></font>

664
00:54:03,782 --> 00:54:05,200
<font color="white">LEE BO-HUN</font><font color="white"></font>

665
00:54:08,078 --> 00:54:10,121
<font color="white">I've been hallucinating</font><font color="white"></font>

666
00:54:11,498 --> 00:54:12,415
<font color="white">my missing friend.</font><font color="white"></font>

667
00:54:13,959 --> 00:54:15,919
<font color="white">I thought if I laid him to rest somehow,</font><font color="white"></font>

668
00:54:17,379 --> 00:54:18,672
<font color="white">things would get better.</font><font color="white"></font>

669
00:54:19,547 --> 00:54:21,007
<font color="white">But it feels like</font><font color="white"></font>

670
00:54:22,467 --> 00:54:23,843
<font color="white">I'm completely consumed…</font><font color="white"></font>

671
00:54:25,929 --> 00:54:27,055
<font color="white">by my dead friend.</font><font color="white"></font>

672
00:54:27,931 --> 00:54:29,057
<font color="white">It's possible</font><font color="white"></font>

673
00:54:29,641 --> 00:54:33,395
<font color="white"><i>that you feel this way</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>because you haven't properly grieved.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

674
00:54:33,478 --> 00:54:34,813
<font color="white"><i>Why don't you instead</i></font><font color="white"></font>

675
00:54:35,313 --> 00:54:38,316
<font color="white"><i>take some time and face your grief?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

676
00:54:39,067 --> 00:54:40,402
<font color="white"><i>Accepting it</i></font><font color="white"></font>

677
00:54:40,485 --> 00:54:43,029
<font color="white"><i>and letting it go is the best thing to do.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

678
00:58:26,419 --> 00:58:29,297
{\an8}<font color="white">SPECIAL THANKS TO KO CHANG-SEOK</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">FOR HIS GUEST APPEARANCE</font><font color="white"></font></font>

679
00:58:49,692 --> 00:58:51,861
<font color="white">FOUR HANDS, TWO SONATAS</font><font color="white"></font>

680
00:58:51,945 --> 00:58:54,948
{\an8}<font color="white">Today's winner, Luca Domenico.</font><font color="white"></font>

681
00:58:55,031 --> 00:58:56,491
{\an8}<font color="white">Choi Jeong-yo has returned.</font><font color="white"></font>

682
00:58:56,574 --> 00:58:58,076
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>I do not wish for my music</i></font><font color="white"></font>

683
00:58:58,159 --> 00:59:00,328
{\an8}<font color="white">to be overshadowed by my past.</font><font color="white"></font>

684
00:59:01,204 --> 00:59:02,705
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>I'd recognize you anywhere.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

685
00:59:03,957 --> 00:59:05,083
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>It's definitely Jeong-yo.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

686
00:59:06,000 --> 00:59:06,834
{\an8}<font color="white">Choi Jeong-yo!</font><font color="white"></font>

687
00:59:06,918 --> 00:59:08,253
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>Please, let me see him.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

688
00:59:08,336 --> 00:59:10,338
{\an8}<font color="white">Mr. Domenico says he doesn't know you.</font><font color="white"></font>

689
00:59:10,838 --> 00:59:12,298
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>I have another request for you.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

690
00:59:13,967 --> 00:59:17,136
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>Look into this quietly</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>and make sure nothing leaks.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

691
00:59:20,348 --> 00:59:25,353
{\an8}<font color="white">Subtitle translation by: Jenny Kim</font><font color="white"></font>
